                                    "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "The inspector has\nwritten OPEN, FIT,\nSET, CLOSE, TEST.\nSomething",
                                        "must happen before\nOPEN, and must\nremain in force\nthrough the",
                                        "open-cover work.\nWhich first action\nmakes this\nsequence safe?\nThis",
                                        "is a planning\ncheck, not a live\nswitch experiment.\nRivet will not",
                                        "open the machine\nuntil the written\norder accounts for\nthe lock card."
                                      ],
